usage: module-nav export [-h] [--html] [--mermaid] [--dot] [-o EXPORT_OUTPUT] name [method]

positional arguments:
  name                  Class name or module name
  method                Method name (for call-chain with --dot)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --html                Generate standalone HTML class report
  --mermaid             Generate Mermaid class diagram for a module
  --dot                 Generate DOT graph (call-chain if method given, module if not)
  -o, --output EXPORT_OUTPUT
                        Output file path (default: exports/<name>.html|.md|.dot)
